                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Fix: Consider adding a retry loop with condition checking instead of fixed sleep:\n```\n# Wait for network to stabilize after deletion.\nWait Until Keyword Succeeds  ${NETWORK_TIMEOUT}s  5s\n...  Verify IPv6 Not Present On BMC  ${ipv6_addr_to_delete}\n```\nWhy: Condition-based waits are more reliable and efficient than fixed sleeps. They make tests more deterministic and reduce overall test execution time."
